<title>ARGENTINA: TABLE - Bansud yr EPS $0.96 vs $0.33.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Bansud yr EPS $0.96 vs $0.33.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30.</p>
<p>Net $42.7 million vs $14.6 million</p>
<p>EPS $0.96 vs $0.33</p>
<p>NOTE: Bansud said its result in the quarter ending June 30 was $12  million while EPS in the quarter was $0.27.</p>
<p>Bansud said its net worth stood at $421.7 million June 30.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0668))</p>
